, 0, 249)">(<em>This live consultation is specifically with Lisa):</em></span></p></span></div><div data-rid="15aded4c-c1c7-4f03-96a9-eb478bfedc7a" class="r-q5mqip"><div data-rid="d982bf1b-a09d-4293-8baf-53354de4d29f" class="r-1pn0fl2"></div><div data-rid="37017784-a2fa-4fec-b36a-ff084466885c" class="r-1dpq7l2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Join Lisa each month for a <strong><em>live virtual group consultation</em></strong>, where you can ask your health, wellness, and weight-loss questions directly.</p></span></div></div></div><button data-rid="01b847a7-493b-4640-bd53-3411c51ef2f4" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-1ozu7wp alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="2d548182-479c-4d07-ba82-c529aecfbefa" class="r-piw8rx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ready to Start Your Gut Reset</p></span></div></button></div></div><div data-rid="62d4cee4-1e51-47f1-99dd-be58119690f3" class="r-o1ha3g"><picture data-rid="6547515f-c861-4cad-a7db-7660cba90152" class="r-1gu0ni1"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/354d9774-1a5f-4409-9b8f-10f225aaff78?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/354d9774-1a5f-4409-9b8f-10f225aaff78?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/354d9774-1a5f-4409-9b8f-10f225aaff78?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/354d9774-1a5f-4409-9b8f-10f225aaff78" class="r-svhm00" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div><div data-rid="f868d5fe-f90e-4d1c-a4b0-fa65c84694be" style="--replo-library-32d30cdb-edb7-48c7-9478-79fc60816f5a-styles-00ad1840-47ff-4ba4-86b5-b467c1ede6bd-attributes-color-background-color:#ffffff" class="r-1er7mib"><div class="r-plp6mp" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="e52a5aac-ad2a-4308-848d