bny96 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Frequently asked Questions</p></span></div><div data-rid="e0f62856-8799-401a-bf2f-859efe8f4047" class="r-186d5m8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your questions answered here</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="0d3c7fba-6721-4354-94c9-be1ddcd23b0f" class="r-7mifn7" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0a261663-ff1b-46c9-ae27-587faedf6e78" class="r-11sx5g3" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8e68ce3f-4314-4fb5-9e37-f6a25bca3384" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-eisy9c"><div data-rid="2b4e33ba-db56-402a-a169-69da99abe3c5" class="r-1wxb6w4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the best way to thaw your juices and smoothies?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ec4ee561-fdf2-4497-806d-658dc8d9e1af" class="r-1bqqnlp"><div data-rid="bab4f097-068c-47b9-9f83-1aac9c44422d" class="r-15389ws" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1unrosq" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3c32:"><div data-rid="c8904204-4201-477d-b505-767f9631d787" class="r-1okvpmv"><div data-rid="f48db424-6bde-4507-9399-afa7ce0457de" class="r-13srknl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your bottles should arrive frozen. Store the bottles in your freezer until you are ready to start drinking them. Thaw out the number of bottles you plan on drinking each day by putting them in your refrigerator. Thawing may take 24-48 hours depending on how cold your refridgerator is. Once thawed, bottles should remain refrigerated and be consumed within 24 hours.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6353e901-487f-40dd-b210-63b19f8c37d3" class="r-id1ocx" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0760c308-990f-4dcb-a1c1-d8f51dfeaaf9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1n89jzd"><div data-rid="0a06a36e-5874-4687-aec2-f061663fd10e" class="r-15na5z7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I leave the juices at room temperature?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5ccf5d29-0a99-4c50-824c-b2b0288a81e2" class="r-xq7cdp"><div data-rid="c48bf949-b43a-408d-8a99-6f28dfaa0b5b" class="r-mmew1r" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-17pkjdb" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5c32:"><div data-rid="9b25ff7d-ed6e-4d76-91d0-44b1d94c2576" class="r-12wsuj0"><div data-rid="430229ac-3f9b-416d-9ddb-4da2acb30650" class="r-1eyzaa9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No, our products need to be kept frozen until you are ready to consume them because they have a very short shelf life. Thaw the bottles in the refrigerator. Thawing may take up to 48 hours depending on how cold your refrigerator is. Once completely thawed our products must be consumed within 24 hours. Our juices taste best when consumed very cold. Shake bottles before you consume.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b999e6a2-a587-464b-b41a-d685edf7ccf0" class="r-1u866mf" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="06ea35fd-de30-4f78-abed-a70dbe80d60a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-cgioh7"><div data-rid="c07b1118-0b17-4b1f-93d0-cf3007f74f66" class="r-zb4w2p alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I eat full meals while following a method program?</p></span></div><div data-rid="da80b900-fdfd-4753-b6f3-ec9fd43d38b2" class="r-1afr82b"><div data-rid="3ee3773f-7734-423e-92ed-f7b7b8ab8d28" class="r-jzfgnc" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1juyi56" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7c32:"><div data-rid="0a03a9a8-454e-47b3-a8a7-b081123c83d3" class="r-p3saoo"><div data-rid="4bdeff00-e957-4090-b008-8b8acdbdaa08" class="r-14r4273 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely, you will be eating meals with these method programs. In addition to the juices, smoothies, and functional shots, you’ll receive easy-to-follow healthy eating tips from our in-house nutritionist and clear guidance for meals and snacks. You’ll learn how to eat in a way that supports weight loss, energy, and well-being.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1bd82235-803a-4578-a836-25fb3fbb67fe" class="r-j70oof" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="fc23cfd1-47ae-44e9-a3d6-fe737c59768d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-xxdv3v"><div data-rid="bd6ca905-a34a-4c0d-8cd5-a54fede50072" class="r-tywc9l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why do you ship the product frozen?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2ed9e962-8ff7-4b25-b2c2-1dbba1689ea7" class="r-1gdzrw2"><div data-rid="9f139986-3e7d-4240-a5c4-f2ce1ac29b67" class="r-vtdfo4" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-d0ixi9" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R9c32:"><div data-rid="451c0e18-fae7-4b5f-9e6e-b23bb56f3b09" class="r-af0j7p"><div data-rid="e6e89768-3d5f-48c7-946a-04e7ee67f8b3" class="r-17qhwpf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It's the only way to truly preserve and lock in flavor, nutrients, and enzymes. Other brands essentially cook out all these good things with their processing methods. Not us. This is as close to juicing at home as you will get. And even better, because you don't have to do any work. And the fact that they arrive frozen means you can enjoy them whenever you want... no more rushing to drink them before they go bad.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="676f04a6-62b3-420e-b7f8-bfcf367c41df" class="r-58p0ct" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f18387fb-e1f4-4a83-89fd-799189509413" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbc32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-7c4s04"><div data-rid="037b2872-736e-4f65-9b91-1b40c98723d6" class="r-3j6nfp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long does delivery take?</p></span></div><div data-rid="7c121918-f160-4f65-8c3b-d50c26551138" class="r-1bc8qft"><div data-rid="81ff3dbb-8948-49c9-821d-25449cd317c0" class="r-z0ew66" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:au